              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരമ്പരാഗത (paramparāgata) from Sanskrit paramparāgata, \"come down in succession\", taken over whole as a tatsama. Its parts are paramparā, \"an unbroken line\", and āgata, \"come\"."
